---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ef3a16f3008e.webp" alt="Ảnh bìa" width="2400" height="1483" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">Chuyến bay hạnh phúc - 2024</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 font-extrabold text-[18px] mb:text-2xl leading-8 font-jp">Chuyến bay hạnh phúc</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[18px] leading-6 font-medium">Minh hoạ : Thuy An - Nội dung : Đào Khương Duy</p>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">Ehon “Chuyến bay hạnh phúc” là tác phẩm đoạt giải đặc biệt tại Giải thưởng Đoá hoa đồng thoại lần thứ 6, được Đoá hoa đồng thoại - Quỹ Bắc Cầu chuyển thể thành ehon. Sách ra mắt tại buổi họp báo đầu tháng 3 năm 2024 ở Bảo tàng Văn học Việt Nam.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://doahoadongthoai.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">Thông tin về sách xem tại đây.</a></p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="Tác phẩm">
        <h2 class="sr-only">Tác phẩm</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-98.25"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/95b49d0f1af8.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 1" width="786" height="974" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-112.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/8e652c6de578.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 2" width="900" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-196.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/53c839868ba5.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 3" width="1572" height="972" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-197"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/3bc761459d75.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 4" width="1577" height="973" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-103.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/9887eb947450.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 5" width="828" height="763" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-98"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/b8c68fa457ad.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 6" width="784" height="972" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/8e4f6cfd88d4.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 7" width="2200" height="1467" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/47d81fd60518.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 8" width="2200" height="1467" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/6300c0565292.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 9" width="2200" height="1467" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/e7adba44b763.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 10" width="2200" height="1467" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/23497e7e643d.webp" alt="Tác phẩm 11" width="2200" height="1467" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/8a57446f6269.webp" alt="Minh họa kết thúc" width="298" height="299" class="block w-50 h-50 mb:w-62.5 mb:h-62.5 rounded-full object-cover object-center mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">Cảm ơn bạn đã xem!</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/vi/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="Quay lại" title="Quay lại"></a>
    </article>
